From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zach Taylor <zctaylor.work@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:15:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/30] ate-setup: k0s install profile for the stigenai fleet

ATE_INSTALL_PROFILE picks the overlay a Kind-profile install renders
(default kind). The k0s overlay layers over the kind manifests: it mounts
the CSI plugin dir from /var/lib/k0s/kubelet, drops the kubelet image
credential provider that k0s lacks, reads the S3 keys from the
ate-s3-credentials Secret, mounts an optional ate-registry-auth Secret as
DOCKER_CONFIG for private actor images, sizes the volumes for a real
cluster, and sends telemetry to the fleet OTLP collector instead of a
bundled one. Device plugins stay at /var/lib/kubelet because kubelet's
DevicePluginPath is a constant.

Fork-Topic: k0s
Fork-Upstream: fork-only
